{"id":1813327,"retrievedAt":"2026-10-31T16:20:01.649Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1813327,"imdb_id":"tt32919118","origin_country":["BA"],"original_language":"bs","original_title":"Posljednja krava u selu","overview":"The main character is Muhamed Zulic from Menjak in Vogosca, near Sarajevo(BiH). His grandma milked cows, his mother milked cows and he, too, milks cows. Once they are gone, there will be no one there to milk cows. Majority of the people in the settlement and the wider area purchase milk and dairy products from him. He mows not only his, but also grass from nearby properties. Those farms are neat and their owners drink milk made, partially, from their grass. After Muhamed and his cow are gone, their grass will be mowed by uniformed agencies and thrown as rubbish or the owners might burn it. They will buy milk in the nearby supermarket. Muhamed is an eyewitness of a time and a place, he remembers meadows before there were buildings. Throughout this film, we will deliver milk, spend time with Muhamed, go hunting. Try to become an eyewitness to a certain place through one lifetime. Why? To record it before it is gone.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/gO5Zs5s0elbfcNPZxlaMeD1tmCb.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":103091,"logo_path":"/8Um5PIJ510tHN32BXqjUt7SwSIP.png","name":"Al Jazeera Balkans","origin_country":"BA"},{"id":107837,"logo_path":null,"name":"Akademija scenskih umjetnosti, Sarajevo","origin_country":"BA"},{"id":298180,"logo_path":null,"name":"Filmadžiluk","origin_country":"BA"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"BA","name":"Bosnia and Herzegovina"}],"release_date":"2021-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":118,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Bosnian","iso_639_1":"bs","name":"Bosanski"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"The Last Cow in the Village","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternat